cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite KEE, please cite the published baseline as below."
title: "KEE (Knowledge, Epistemics & Eidos)"
type: software
version: 0.11.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
authors:
  - family-names: Yap
    given-names: René
repository-code: "https://github.com/KnoEdg/kee"
url: "https://w3id.org/kee"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A governed profile family over PROV, SKOS, DCTerms, OWL-Time and SHACL for
  keeping knowledge artifacts interpretable as they move between people,
  organizations, software systems, and through time. The published baseline
  comprises the specification, the term declarations, the SHACL shape graphs,
  the SKOS concept schemes, the JSON Schemas, the JSON-LD context, examples,
  and conformance fixtures.
keywords:
  - provenance
  - shacl
  - rdf
  - prov-o
  - skos
  - knowledge-graph
  - interoperability
